# A spell on the stack has the creature types of the card (CR 205.3, 604.3): Firdoch Core's Changeling (CR 702.73a) makes
# it a Kithkin spell, though it is no creature spell, so Door of Destinies - which chose Kithkin as it entered - charges
# when the Core is cast (the Core is a Kindred Artifact: CR 205.3m gives a Kindred creature types). Ornithopter, a
# Thopter, cast first on turn 3, is the control: no charge counter. Bot1 casts the Door with four Moxen on turn 1 and
# the Core with three on turn 3.

